# Patterns are anchored to the build context: use **/ for nested folders,
# or packages/*/node_modules and stale packages/*/dist leak into the image.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
.git/
.github/
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage/
**/.agentboard/
.agents/
.claude/
**/*.db
npm-debug.log*
docker-compose*.yml
